OL,3,GNEWSACouncils to share #5m in
OL,4,A'emergency food aid' as living costs
OL,5,Arise
OL,6,
OL,7,FWelsh councils will receive #4.8
OL,8,Fmillion to provide "emergency food aid"
OL,9,Fand other support for people struggling
OL,10,Fdue to cost of living pressures.
OL,12,FThe cash from the Welsh government will
OL,13,Fbe split between the 22 local
OL,14,Fauthorities, with those in rural areas
OL,15,Fgetting a premium due to "the added
OL,16,Fchallenges" of delivering support to
OL,17,Fmore sparsely populated regions.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,433,430,260,140,0,100
