OL,3,GNEWSACouncils to share #5m in
OL,4,A'emergency food aid' as living costs
OL,5,Arise
OL,6,
OL,7,FDeputy First Minister Sioned Williams
OL,8,Fsaid rising fuel and energy costs meant
OL,9,Fmany families faced another "tough
OL,10,Fwinter" and she was "targeting support
OL,11,Fwhere it's needed most".
OL,13,FReform UK Wales said it welcomed the
OL,14,Fsupport, but said the government could
OL,15,Fdo more to help people in need.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
